  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. This release introduces a new major version of the Amazon Macie API. You can use this version of the API to develop tools and applications that interact with the new Amazon Macie.",
